Subject: Respect device wakeup policy for the SM-G955N WLAN system IRQ

The legacy driver armed HOST_WAKE at registration independently of the
configured triggers. Keep the runtime IRQ, but on this board register it
with the generic wake IRQ code during system suspend only when the user
opts in through the device's power/wakeup setting. RTC and key wakeups
use separate devices. Preserve the existing policy on other boards.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd4361/dhd_pcie_linux.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd4361/dhd_pcie_linux.c
@@ -69,10 +69,11 @@
